        "Abstract": "Large language models are commonly trained on a mixture of filtered web data and curated 'high-quality' corpora. We show that properly filtered and deduplicated web data alone can lead to powerful models, outperforming models trained on curated corpora. We publicly release an extract of 600 billion tokens from our RefinedWeb dataset."
